+   --planning-datasets CSV          Override the Planning Data dataset list
+   --planning-geometry FILE         Extracted planning-plan GeoJSON; repeatable
++  --planning-authority-discovery   Resolve the local authority and search its bounded public portal
++  --planning-site-alias TEXT       Additional park/site/address alias; repeatable
++  --planning-portal-config FILE    Additional authority portal registry JSON; repeatable
++  --planning-portal-max-queries 8  Maximum bounded site-alias searches per authority
++  --planning-portal-max-applications 120
++                                    Maximum authority portal applications inspected
+   --planning-documents             Discover and catalogue application documents automatically
+   --planning-document-mode extract off, discover, download, or embedded-text extraction
+   --planning-document-max-applications 80
